{"title":"2010 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_2\">Problem 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A big <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/9/859ccf4cd60c7bc6b8fa1afc9a42dc811a826d6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$L$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> is formed as shown. What is its area?\n</p>\n<center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/2/122a4290575eda1b63a0b302c47384ced6bb393e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] unitsize(4mm); defaultpen(linewidth(.8pt));  draw((0,0)--(5,0)--(5,2)--(2,2)--(2,8)--(0,8)--cycle); label(&quot;8&quot;,(0,4),W); label(&quot;5&quot;,(5/2,0),S); label(&quot;2&quot;,(5,1),E); label(&quot;2&quot;,(1,8),N); [/asy]\" width=\"132\" height=\"195\" /></center>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/b/38b18ed553eb360bacc2afdd32cf79cfff36a3d8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 22 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 24 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 26 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 28 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"394\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We find the area of the big rectangle to be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/0/740ef6e0d64563c4a74168709993fd2759913d9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8 \\times 5 = 40$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"82\" height=\"13\" />, and the area of the smaller rectangle to be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/8/63870fb36f67e9ef13cc2e70f392a733a2c953cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(8 - 2) \\times (5 - 2) = 18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"173\" height=\"18\" />. The answer is then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/1/281a4deb9e86dcec7aa5fa195078c46a571720ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40 - 18 = 22$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"100\" height=\"13\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/5/565ab5e3715db52b9176b04dd9991b71f4e93a86.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(A)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"26\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B\" title=\"2010 AMC 12B\">2010 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2010 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2010 AMC 12B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2010 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=20